@startuml
' Figure 23-1: each runtime test file -> the coverage claim it evidences -> the unbounded Rocq
' theory that proves it (doc 22) -> the finite/symbolic complement that floors it (executable).
' Three evidence tiers per family: a firing test (it fires in Rho), a corrupted-sigma probe
' (it is a REPLACEMENT, not a report duplicate), and an unbounded proof.
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName monospaced
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
}
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
left to right direction

title Figure 23-1 — test file  =>  coverage claim  =>  unbounded proof (doc 22)  =>  executable floor\nfive family clusters; each cluster: a firing test (blue) + a corrupted-<latex>\sigma</latex> probe (orange) evidence the in-Rho claim (grey), proved by a Rocq theory (green), floored by a finite model (purple)

